# Add only investigated benign reports or false positives, with the reason for each suppression.

# A mirror's state (PoolRec.mstate) and buffer, read on vk_mem_use's unlocked fast path while another replay worker's
# mirror_create sets them under use_lock (vk_memory.c). Benign: the buffer is made before MS_ON is stored, the mirror's
# first copy is queued by the same use_lock hold, and the part's prologue that holds it is built after group_drain, so
# the GPU runs the copy before any chunk's draw that binds the mirror. Atomic accesses there cost about 2% in Kokiri
# Forest on the bench, so they were taken out (https://github.com/Larbaco/NX2Saria/pull/49#issuecomment-7049824103,
# https://github.com/Larbaco/NX2Saria/pull/49#issuecomment-7064849565). race_top: only reports whose racing access is
# in vk_mem_use itself, not those that merely pass through it.
race_top:vk_mem_use
